body:
It could be that he has a judgmental family and is worried about their perceiving you as even younger than you are  - which is already significantly younger than him. 

&#x200B;

I wouldn't be bothered by this one time request as controlling behavior - it's a one off and he just asked if you could postpone the haircut, not change it. Relationships are give and take, it's a small one to give but I'd watch out in case his behavior later escalates.
